# Inherited from a HuggingFace Space template. The ML weight formats below
# will never appear in this repo, but they are harmless.
#
# *.png / *.pdf / *.zip were REMOVED from LFS deliberately: this repo's images
# and sample documents are a few hundred KB, so LFS bought nothing, and anyone
# cloning without git-lfs installed silently got pointer text files instead of
# the logo and the sample documents — a broken UI with no error to explain it.
*.npy filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.7z filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.arrow filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
